3:["$","p","p-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Research first."}]," We interviewed parents, teachers, and administrators before designing anything. The insight that shaped everything: most parents browse exclusively on inexpensive Android phones, often on 3G. Performance wasn't a nice-to-have — it was the product."]}]
